concepts.body_md:
**Prompt** us conversation ke andar ek instruction hai jisme tum pehle se ho. Woh sab kuch usi conversation se udhaar leta hai: uski history, uske tools, uska permission mode, aur jawab check karne ke liye tumhara attention. **Template** ek prompt hai jise tumne save kar liya taaki dobara paste kar sako. Claude Code mein template ka saved, versioned form **skill** hai (`.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`): wahi idea, plus supporting files, arguments (`$ARGUMENTS`, pehle argument ke liye `$0`) aur ek optional `/name` entry point.

**Agent** (Claude Code subagent, `.claude/agents/<name>.md`) wording mein nahi, kind mein alag hai. `build/CLAUDE_CODE_FACTS.md` §1 ke hisaab se uske paas hota hai:

- **apna context window**: woh apni file body ko system prompt, task message, CLAUDE.md hierarchy, git status aur koi bhi preloaded `skills` ke saath start hota hai. Use tumhari conversation history, Claude Code system prompt, tumhara output style ya auto memory **nahi** milti;
- **apni tool boundary**: `tools` ek allowlist hai, `disallowedTools` ek denylist;
- **apni authority**: `permissionMode`, `maxTurns`, `model`, optional `memory`, `hooks` aur `isolation: worktree`;
- **ek loop**: woh tab tak tools call karta rehta hai jab tak use lage ki kaam ho gaya, phir main session ko **ek final message** return karta hai.

Isliye practical test yeh nahi hai ki "prompt lamba hai kya". Test yeh hai: *kya is kaam ko us conversation se alag context, alag tools, ya alag authority chahiye jo ise maang rahi hai?* Jis context ne code likha, usi ka likha code review independent nahi hai. Jis reviewer ke paas `Edit` hai, woh chupchaap wahi fix kar sakta hai jise judge karne ko kaha gaya tha. Yeh aisi problems hain jo better prompt solve nahi kar sakta, par subagent definition kar sakti hai.

Cost bhi real hai: subagent un files ko dobara padhta hai jo main session pehle se jaanta hai, aur jo bhi tum uske task message mein daalna bhool gaye, woh uske paas hota hi nahi. Isliye practically tum prompt ko agent tabhi banate ho jab isolation, tool boundary ya repeatable independent opinion us cost ke layak ho.
